Description: Show the globe of the map widget in stereo 3D on Wayland
 The globe is drawn once for each eye (one world, two cameras orbiting its
 centre), shown side by side by a layer under the window's surface and
 declared as full side by side stereo content; the interface stays on the
 screen plane. View > Stereo 3D, off by default, offered only where the
 compositor takes stereo content.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, https://github.com/danielcamposramos (branch stereo3d, Marble v26.04.0)
Forwarded: no
